{
  "_comment": [
    "The lanes .github/workflows/test-repeat.yml runs new and changed tests on.",
    "Each lane mirrors one job of flutter-ci.yml (or device-tests-manual.yml):",
    "its runner, its working directory, the files it runs and the exact command",
    "it runs them with. Keep the two in step: when flutter-ci.yml starts to run",
    "a test, or runs it another way, change its lane here too.",
    "scripts/test_repeat_test.py checks that every lane's runner and files",
    "still match the job named in `mirrors`.",
    "",
    "files: test files the lane runs, repo-relative; each may be an object",
    "  with its own args and env. include: globs (** for any directories) when",
    "  the job runs a whole directory. test_on: the platform names a file's",
    "  @TestOn expression is evaluated against; a file that does not run there",
    "  is left out. deps: files whose change reruns every file of the lane.",
    "command: {file} is the test relative to cwd, {files} all of them (batch",
    "  lanes run every file in one invocation), {args} the file's args,",
    "  {seed} the shuffle seed, {report} the JSON report path, {python} the",
    "  running Python. $NAME is read from the environment. env values also",
    "  take {root}, the repository root.",
    "fixed_minutes (the job's setup), build_minutes (the cold build in each",
    "  job's first run, plus build_minutes in a file entry that builds the app",
    "  another way), iteration_minutes and run_minutes (per file and run, or",
    "  minutes in a file entry) are measured times the planner uses to keep",
    "  each job under budget_fraction of timeout, sharding the runs when not.",
    "  timeout is the job's own timeout, except ios-simulator: 120 minutes",
    "  (its job has 90) since each of its jobs pays a 25 minute cold build.",
    "auto: false lanes run only when a dispatch names them in `lanes`.",
    "setup.android.step_limit: the emulator step gets its own limit, half of",
    "  the job's time after fixed_minutes, as the API 24 job in",
    "  device-tests-manual.yml has, and the runs are split so that the step",
    "  stays within budget_fraction of it. setup.hooks_cache: restores the",
    "  example's build hook output that the mirrored job's cache step names",
    "  (build-macos: macos); test-repeat.yml never saves it.",
    "setup.android.downloads: the Gradle download cache entry the mirrored",
    "  job names (the gradle-plugin-repositories action's downloads input),",
    "  which test-repeat.yml only restores."
  ],
  "limits": {
    "default_runs": 10,
    "max_runs": 50,
    "budget_fraction": 0.6,
    "max_shards": 3,
    "max_jobs": {
      "pull_request": 8,
      "workflow_dispatch": 16
    }
  },
  "test_roots": [
    "test",
    "example/integration_test",
    "example/test",
    "example/flex_test_host/integration_test",
    "example/flex_test_host/test",
    "example/play_services_test_host/integration_test",
    "example_web/integration_test"
  ],
  "lanes": {
    "repeat-plan": {
      "auto": true,
      "runner": "ubuntu-24.04",
      "timeout": 20,
      "setup": {},
      "cwd": ".",
      "files": ["scripts/test_repeat_test.py"],
      "deps": [
        "scripts/test_repeat.py",
        ".github/test-lanes.json",
        ".github/workflows/test-repeat.yml"
      ],
      "batch": true,
      "report": false,
      "command": ["{python}", "-I", "{files}"],
      "fixed_minutes": 1,
      "build_minutes": 0,
      "iteration_minutes": 0,
      "run_minutes": 0.15
    },
    "unit-macos": {
      "auto": true,
      "mirrors": "flutter-ci.yml:build-macos",
      "runner": "macos-26",
      "timeout": 60,
      "setup": {"flutter": true, "desktop": "macos", "pub_get": ["."]},
      "cwd": ".",
      "include": ["test/**/*_test.dart"],
      "test_on": ["vm", "dart-vm", "mac-os", "posix"],
      "batch": true,
      "shuffle": true,
      "command": ["flutter", "test", "--reporter", "expanded", "--test-randomize-ordering-seed={seed}", "--file-reporter", "json:{report}", "{files}"],
      "fixed_minutes": 2.5,
      "build_minutes": 0.3,
      "iteration_minutes": 0.3,
      "run_minutes": 0.015
    },
    "unit-linux": {
      "auto": true,
      "mirrors": "flutter-ci.yml:build-linux",
      "runner": "ubuntu-24.04",
      "timeout": 45,
      "setup": {"flutter": true, "apt": "clang cmake ninja-build pkg-config libgtk-3-dev liblzma-dev xvfb", "desktop": "linux", "pub_get": ["."]},
      "cwd": ".",
      "include": ["test/**/*_test.dart"],
      "test_on": ["vm", "dart-vm", "linux", "posix"],
      "batch": true,
      "shuffle": true,
      "command": ["flutter", "test", "--reporter", "expanded", "--test-randomize-ordering-seed={seed}", "--file-reporter", "json:{report}", "{files}"],
      "fixed_minutes": 3,
      "build_minutes": 0.2,
      "iteration_minutes": 0.1,
      "run_minutes": 0.01
    },
    "unit-windows": {
      "auto": true,
      "mirrors": "flutter-ci.yml:build-windows",
